t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>President Donald J. Trump is delivering on his promise to the American worker: build it here, power it here, and put paychecks back in the communities Washington left behind.</strong> In a matter of weeks, President Trump has locked in a run of steel, nuclear, gas, shipbuilding, and medical manufacturing commitments that will hire American workers and strengthen American security.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>President Trump</strong> <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2104640636297388141\"><strong>announced</strong></a> <strong>that Mesabi Metallics will build a</strong> <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/mined-melted-and-poured-in-america-president-trump-reverses-years-of-anti-mining-policy/\"><strong>$15 billion steel complex</strong></a> <strong>in Iowa — the largest steel plant ever built in the United States.</strong> Fed by American iron ore and driven by the Trump Administration’s steel tariffs, the fully integrated mine-to-mill complex will create 1,750 new, permanent jobs, support up to 6,000 construction jobs, and generate an estimated $95 billion in economic output.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>President Trump and Anduril</strong> <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2107566035507593450\"><strong>announced</strong></a> <strong>Arsenal-2, the biggest new American shipyard push since World War II, now moving forward in Maryland.</strong> The yard will produce critical Virginia-class components and large assemblies, create about 3,100 direct jobs, and support more than 11,000 indirect jobs. Anduril is investing $3.7 billion in private capital; the Navy is putting up to $2.9 billion behind it as part of the Trump Administration’s push to reshore America’s defense industrial base.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>President Trump</strong> <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2105398496077521257\"><strong>unveiled</strong></a> <strong>a South Korean energy investment package of up to $200 billion in the United States.</strong> The package <a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2105398496077521257\">includes</a> as much as $120 billion to build eight large-scale nuclear plants, $54 billion tied to the Alaska LNG pipeline, and $22.3 billion for a six-gigawatt natural gas power facility in Texas.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Vice President Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://www.foxbusiness.com/politics/trump-admin-invoking-defense-production-act-new-alaska-power-grid-project-touted-vance\"><strong>announced</strong></a> <strong>that the Department of Energy will invest $150 million to advance a major new transmission line in Alaska.</strong> The project includes 223 miles linking the Beluga power station on the southern coast with Healy in the Interior, a corridor serving ports and nearly three-quarters of the state’s population.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Becton Dickinson</strong> <a href=\"https://news.bd.com/2026-10-06-BD-and-U-S-Government-Launch-Landmark-Partnership-to-Expand-U-S-Manufacturing-and-Strengthen-Americas-Healthcare-Resilience\"><strong>announced</strong></a> <strong>a $19 billion U.S. investment under a landmark partnership with the Trump Administration, including $3 billion to expand American manufacturing.</strong> BD will produce 100% of the needles it sells in America with American-made steel and expand domestic output of essential products.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>AstraZeneca</strong> <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/astrazeneca-opens-new-massachusetts-rd-center-part-1-billion-investment-2026-10-05/\"><strong>announced</strong></a> <strong>a $1 billion investment in Massachusetts under the $50 billion investment commitment it made in its Most Favored Nation</strong> <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/10/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-announces-second-deal-to-bring-most-favored-nation-pricing-to-american-patients/\"><strong>agreement</strong></a> <strong>with the Trump Administration.</strong> The company is expanding its domestic research and manufacturing operation and growing its domestic workforce.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-is-putting-american-industry-jobs-and-paychecks-back-on-the-map/\">President Trump Is Putting American Industry, Jobs, and Paychecks Back on the Map</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
